flowchart TD
    Start([Selector.poll调用]) --> Clear[清空完成列表<br/>completedSends<br/>completedReceives]
    Clear --> CheckBuffered{有缓冲数据?}
    
    CheckBuffered -->|是| SetTimeout0[设置timeout=0<br/>立即处理]
    CheckBuffered -->|否| Select[调用nioSelector.select<br/>等待I/O事件]
    
    SetTimeout0 --> Select
    
    Select --> CheckReady{有事件就绪?}
    CheckReady -->|否| Timeout[超时返回]
    CheckReady -->|是| GetKeys[获取selectedKeys]
    
    GetKeys --> ProcessKeys[处理SelectionKey]
    
    ProcessKeys --> CheckType{事件类型}
    
    CheckType -->|OP_CONNECT| HandleConnect[处理连接事件<br/>channel.finishConnect]
    CheckType -->|OP_WRITE| HandleWrite[处理写事件<br/>channel.write]
    CheckType -->|OP_READ| HandleRead[处理读事件<br/>channel.read]
    
    HandleConnect --> UpdateConnected[添加到connected列表]
    HandleWrite --> CheckWriteComplete{写入完成?}
    CheckWriteComplete -->|是| AddCompletedSend[添加到completedSends]
    CheckWriteComplete -->|否| KeepWriteInterest[保持写兴趣]
    
    HandleRead --> ParseResponse[解析响应数据]
    ParseResponse --> CheckComplete{响应完整?}
    CheckComplete -->|是| AddCompletedReceive[添加到completedReceives]
    CheckComplete -->|否| BufferData[缓冲数据<br/>等待下次读取]
    
    UpdateConnected --> End
    AddCompletedSend --> End
    KeepWriteInterest --> End
    AddCompletedReceive --> End
    BufferData --> End
    Timeout --> End
    
    End([返回处理结果])
    
    style Select fill:#ffcccc
    style ProcessKeys fill:#ccffcc
    style AddCompletedReceive fill:#ffffcc

